a</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Katwere</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Piloya</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Feld</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Opio</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Kambugu</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Katabira</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name><name><surname>Thomas</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Colebunders</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Ronald</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><article-title>The spectrum of liver diseases in HIV infected individuals at an HIV treatment clinic in Kampala, Uganda</article-title><source>Afr Health Sci</source><year>2008</year><volume>8</volume><issue>1</issue><fpage>8</fpage><lpage>12</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">19357726</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="B12"><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><name><surname>Hou</surname><given-names>W</given-names></name><name><surname>Sanyal</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><article-title>Ascites: diagnosis and management</article-title><source>Med Clin North Am</source><year>2009</year><volume>93</volume><fpage>801</fpage><lpage>817</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/j.mcna.2009.03.007</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">19577115</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="B13"><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><name><surname>Tuzun</surname><given-names>Y</given-names></name><name><surname>Yilmaz</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Dursun</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Canoruc</surname><given-names>F</given-names></name><name><surname>Celik</surname><given-names>Y</given-names></name><name><surname>Cil</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Boyraz</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><article-title>How to increase the diag